{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49981","headline":"句 · 张萧远","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"须臾满寺泉声合，百尺飞檐挂玉绳。\n座客醉来云雨散，一行高鸟万山秋。\n绮罗香里春长在，丝管声中水暗流。\n何事不归巫峡去，故来人世断人肠。\n身居晓嶂红霞外，书读秋窗紫竹间。\n瀑布水高清汉冷，莓苔桥滑碧烟虚。\n日月在天常照耀，了无尘垢污清光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张萧远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49981.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49981","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}